pg:Q1_O0 a ld:AnswerOption ;
    rdfs:label "The book dates the first description of the network to February 2015 (Antonopoulos and Harding, 2023), and Wikipedia agrees, citing a copy of version 0.5 of the paper archived on 28 February 2015 (Wikipedia contributors, 2026)."@en .

pg:Q1_O1 a ld:AnswerOption ;
    rdfs:label "BOLT 11 lists invoices to test a parser, among them the one for a cup of coffee, 2500 micro-bitcoin, to be paid within a minute (Lightning developers, 2026)."@en .

